              "marks": [],
              "text": "Hotels in Sohag"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Comfort and Hospitality by the Nile"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sohag offers a range of accommodation options to suit the needs of its visitors. This guide highlights prominent hotels that provide comfort, convenience, and a touch of local charm."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Top Accommodations in Sohag"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Al Safa Hotel"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Strategically positioned on the west bank of the Nile, Al Safa Hotel offers easy access to the city’s new museum, located just across the river. The hotel boasts comfortable rooms and a riverside terrace, a favorite spot for evening relaxation where guests can enjoy snacks, soft drinks, and water pipes while soaking in the serene riverside ambiance."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Location: 15 El Gomhoureya St., Gharb District,"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sohag, Egypt"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Al-Nil Hotel"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Situated on the east bank of the Nile, Al-Nil Hotel is a newer addition to Sohag’s hospitality scene. Its proximity to the new museum and its position across from Al-Safa Hotel make it a conveniently located choice for visitors. The hotel is known for its well-equipped rooms, many of which offer stunning views of the Nile, providing a blend of comfort and elegance."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000019",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Location: East Bank of the Nile, Sohag, Egypt"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El Andalous Hotel"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "This is a very nice small hotel in Sohag with its perfect location just in front of the railway station, offering easy access to nearly everywhere in Sohag. Guests appreciate its convenience and the warm hospitality provided."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Location: Opposite Sohag Railway Station, Sohag, Egypt"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Al Amir Palace Hotel"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Located in the heart of Sohag, Al Amir Palace Hotel offers guests a comfortable stay with easy access to the city's main attractions. The hotel is known for its friendly staff and clean accommodations, making it a suitable choice for travelers seeking convenience and value."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000025",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Location: Al Kabsh, Sohag, Egypt"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000027",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nile Elite Sohag"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000029",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nile Elite Sohag is located in Sūhāj, offering facilities such as a restaurant, room service, and a 24-hour front desk, along with free WiFi. Each room has air conditioning and a flat-screen TV. A buffet breakfast is available daily, and the hotel features a swimming pool for guests to enjoy."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Location: Nasser Harbour, In front of Ahli United Bank, University Branch, Sohag, Egypt"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
