          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Egypt's Finest Stays & Nile Cruises: Luxurious Retreats Await"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000033",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Indulge in unparalleled comfort with our curated guide to Egypt’s best hotels and Nile cruises. Experience luxurious accommodations and majestic river journeys that blend modern amenities with enchanting views. Ready for an exquisite escape? Click to discover your perfect Egyptian retreat!"
            }
